WEBVTT

24:01.306 --> 24:05.559
You actually think
you're the Buzz Lightyear?

24:06.019 --> 24:08.646
Oh, all this time
I thought it was an act!

24:08.730 --> 24:12.525
Hey, guys, look!
It's the real Buzz Lightyear!

24:12.609 --> 24:13.859
You're mocking me,
aren't you?

24:13.944 --> 24:16.695
Oh, no, no. No, no, no, no, no.
Buzz, look, an alien!

24:16.780 --> 24:18.197
Where?

24:25.914 --> 24:27.456
Yes!
